GIT has 3 stages.
1) working directory (indulo manam application or emina devlop chesa code rastam kani track avadu)
     ⬇️
    git add( e command execute chesaka mana working directory lo unna files staging area ki veltaii)
     ⬇️
2) staging area (ikada ki vachaka manam files ni track cheychu ant evaru em changes chesina manam chudachu)
     ⬇️
    git commit( e command execute chesta mana files staging nunchi local repository martuaiii)
     ⬇️
3) repository 
 repository lo kuda mankiki 2 tupes untaii
 1) local repository (ante evaru ayte valla code vall machaine rastaro apudu comit chestaro apudu adhi local repo after git commit mana code local repo ki marutindi)
 2) remote repository(code raska oka central repository ki push chestaru migilina developers kuda a code acces cheydaniki using git push to store in cemtral repos like github,gitlab...)
