Branches:
manaki by deafult ga master ani branch untadi.

- main branch ante trunk.
- Meeru kotha feature add cheyyali, leka bug fix cheyyali ante, trunk nunchi oka branch create chestaru.
- Idi main code ni disturb cheyyakunda separate ga pani cheyyadaniki upayogisthundi

🛠 Branch enduku vadali?
- Safe ga test cheyyadam – main code disturb kakunda.
- Team lo andariki separate pani – prati developer tana branch lo pani cheyyachu.
- Organized workflow – features, fixes, releases ni separate ga manage cheyyachu

<git branch> to check current branch.
<git branch name> to create a new branch.
<git checkout/switch name> to switch from one branch to another branch.
<git merge (branch name)> to merge a branch with current working branch.
<git checkout -b (branch name)> to crate a new branch & siwitch to that branch at a time.
<git branch -d (branch name)> to delete a branch 
Note: 
     we can't delete a branch if we are in that branch.
     we can't able to delete a branch with out merging to master if we commit in that branch. But using one command we can.
<git branch -D (branch name)> to delete a branch without merging.
<git branch -m (old-name) (new-name)> to change a branch name.
